%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 97028838fcdf09046bb2f92640945ac4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Ending
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  lines:
  - speaker: 2
    text: Mrs. Darwin, your office confirmed the entire delivery for nine tomorrow
      morning.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "What? No. That order won\u2019t be ready until next week."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: Then why did your employee guarantee it?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: My employee?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: The one who called from your office. Very confident. Apparently, very wrong.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "That was the intern. There\u2019s been a misunderstanding."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: We scheduled staff and made promises to our own customers based on that
      call.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Let me sort this out\u2014"
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "We\u2019re cancelling the partnership. Send any remaining paperwork by
      email."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Wait\u2014"
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: Goodbye, Mrs. Darwin.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: INTERN C'MERE BOY
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: If this is about the coffee, I followed the recipe.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: DID YOU PROMISE OUT PARTNER A FULL DELIVERY TOMORROW??
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: They asked if it would be ready. I said yes.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: WITHOUT EVEN FUCKING CHECKING?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: You told me to sound confident.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: I told you to sound confident. NOT BEING DUMB
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: To be fair, they invented the date. I just supported it.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "They\u2019ve cancelled the partnership."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "\u2026So I shouldn\u2019t mark that task as complete?"
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "You\u2019re fired."
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: On my first day?
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: Congratulations. You finished early.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: Okay, Grandma.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: GET OUT.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: (thinking) Made coffee. Found a mouse. Ended a partnership.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: (thinking) Pretty productive first day.
    useAction: 0
    onShownAction: []
    onAdvancedAction: []
    onShown:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onAdvanced:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
